[{"title":"言老自云堂携十六大士画像见过与世间传写者不同惊喜赞叹因成二偈 其二","author":"吴芾","text":"水旱无忧不用祈，祇祈心事莫相违。\n我今衰老浑如许，惟仗神通放取归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43372,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"言老自云堂携十六大士画像见过与世间传写者不同惊喜赞叹因成二偈 其一","author":"吴芾","text":"禅月定中观妙相，神奇古怪乃如斯。\n起来援笔一挥扫，惊杀人间老画师。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43373,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"陈子厚送韶鸭将以七绝因次其韵 其四","author":"吴芾","text":"朝朝两两下平沙，添得湖中景趣嘉。\n碧卵从今生育去，便堪装点作渔家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43374,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"陈子厚送韶鸭将以七绝因次其韵 其三","author":"吴芾","text":"湖光深处恣沉浮，未让波间鹭与鸥。\n旧侣此时应羡汝，欲来相就苦无由。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43375,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"陈子厚送韶鸭将以七绝因次其韵 其六","author":"吴芾","text":"初来便自与人宜，相近相亲自在飞。\n底事悠然无畏忌，也知老子久忘机。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43376,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"陈子厚送韶鸭将以七绝因次其韵 其一","author":"吴芾","text":"久闻韶鸭有灵踪，首尾俱轻快御风。\n公独惠然持见赠，应知野性与余同。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43377,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"陈子厚送韶鸭将以七绝因次其韵 其二","author":"吴芾","text":"兴在江湖万里间，洿池一曲岂能安。\n今朝来我西湖上，眼底陡惊天地宽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43378,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"陈子厚送韶鸭将以七绝因次其韵 其七","author":"吴芾","text":"虽是微禽亦美观，岂无缯弋欲相干。\n不须更起高飞念，且向湖中戢羽翰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43379,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"饭客看鹤赏梅遇雨有作","author":"吴芾","text":"鹤舞梅开总有情，小园方喜得双清。\n无端风雨妨游览，不使衰翁眼暂明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43380,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"到仪真沙河阻风三首 其三","author":"吴芾","text":"连日狂风已作难，今朝浊浪更如山。\n江神坚我归田志，故示危机一水间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43381,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"到仪真沙河阻风三首 其二","author":"吴芾","text":"求退那知却冒迁，天心人意古难全。\n今朝行役还堪笑，下水船为上水船。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43382,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"到仪真沙河阻风三首 其一","author":"吴芾","text":"快意由来未易逢，顺流却值打头风。\n篙师知是江神怒，引棹重回小浦中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43383,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"周相士谓予寿至九十三又成一绝","author":"吴芾","text":"年登九九已云多，相士犹添十载过。\n万事都捐无复念，老而不死待如何。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43384,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和十二弟梅花","author":"吴芾","text":"春到衡门苦恨迟，遍寻竹外赏南枝。\n夜来已报春消息，试问主人知不知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43385,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和子仪送箭笋二首 其二","author":"吴芾","text":"满合圆如玉箸匀，一开喜气顿生春。\n非君与我谁知味，俗客惟誇嗜八珍。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43386,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和子仪送箭笋二首 其一","author":"吴芾","text":"与君林下久相从，蔬笋由来嗜好同。\n不饷腥膻惟饷此，想应知我旧家风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43387,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和天予二首 其二","author":"吴芾","text":"吾子才如千里驹，肯同泛泛水中凫。\n乘时早取封侯印，莫惮郊原骨已枯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43388,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和天予二首 其一","author":"吴芾","text":"自昔常难四者并，一杯相属意非轻。\n祇今欲破愁城去，赖子时来举酒兵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43389,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和王知府惠双井茶","author":"吴芾","text":"摘从双井尚馀香，远寄山翁见未尝。\n咀嚼新芽味新句，陡惊冰雪沃枯肠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43390,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和王知府惠瓦砚","author":"吴芾","text":"文房四子旧周旋，老去情疏祇自怜。\n不谓陶泓犹见念，远来相顾不相捐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43391,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和任宰元绍见寄十首以归来问信湖山抚摩松菊为韵 其二","author":"吴芾","text":"绿鬓久垂雪，壮心今已灰。\n翩然归旧隐，端似再生来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43392,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和任宰元绍见寄十首以归来问信湖山抚摩松菊为韵 其八","author":"吴芾","text":"人心生剑戟，世路足风波。\n祇有归田好，谁能自揣摩。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43393,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和任宰元绍见寄十首以归来问信湖山抚摩松菊为韵 其五","author":"吴芾","text":"四围山绕舍，一带水平湖。\n远近俱堪画，登临自足娱。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43394,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和任宰元绍见寄十首以归来问信湖山抚摩松菊为韵 其七","author":"吴芾","text":"闲穿脩竹行，时把孤松抚。\n身世两相忘，恍如居洞府。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43395,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和任宰元绍见寄十首以归来问信湖山抚摩松菊为韵 其一","author":"吴芾","text":"出仕惭无补，长年咏式微。\n天公怜我意，一旦许来归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43396,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和任宰元绍见寄十首以归来问信湖山抚摩松菊为韵 其六","author":"吴芾","text":"开门无一事，终日饱看山。\n石罅鸣流水，翻惊响佩环。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43397,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和任路分喜雨","author":"吴芾","text":"一雨欢声已沸传，更观佳句倍欣然。\n一时果遂为霖望，会见重书大有年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43398,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和刘与仁见寄","author":"吴芾","text":"莫为穷愁赋七歌，会须终日饮无何。\n人间佳士由来少，世上浮名未足多。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43399,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和刘与权韵三首 其三","author":"吴芾","text":"异县相望两驿间，何时复此共看山。\n向来同社今无几，莫惜篮舆数往还。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43400,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和刘与权韵三首 其二","author":"吴芾","text":"去年君过我山中，尊酒相欢十日同。\n别后相思肠欲断，暮云空复指江东。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43401,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和刘与权韵三首 其一","author":"吴芾","text":"平生嗜好唯爱山，前身疑是山中相。\n归来深处得幽栖，柴门正与山相向。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43402,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和许守松阴","author":"吴芾","text":"乔松转日影斜斜，穿入疏棂细作花。\n怪得清阴长不改，原来松下蛰龟蛇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43403,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和许守游春 其三","author":"吴芾","text":"尊前莫惜千金费，醉里能令万事轻。\n须信人生行乐耳，此身何用绊浮名。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43404,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和许守游春 其一","author":"吴芾","text":"玉蕊琼葩压众芳，一时纵赏拥如墙。\n花边笑索银瓶酒，知是谁家白面郎。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43405,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和许守游春 其二","author":"吴芾","text":"结客行行入翠微，桃源深处醉芳菲。\n狂歌不减刘公干，尽日花间坐不归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43406,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和李民载梅花二首 其二","author":"吴芾","text":"独坐无聊感岁华，骚人忽寄一枝花。\n虽无素手簪罗髻，已觉春生野老家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43407,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和李民载梅花二首 其一","author":"吴芾","text":"褐衣怀玉未全贫，况有梅花作好春。\n丽句与花相映发，总输天上谪仙人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43408,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和远老四首 其四","author":"吴芾","text":"相逢正好共看山，底事匆匆便欲还。\n今日乍晴山更好，可能伴我片时閒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43409,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和远老四首 其三","author":"吴芾","text":"世人老去不知休，祇羡三公与五侯。\n争似山僧都不会，困来衲被便蒙头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43410,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和远老四首 其二","author":"吴芾","text":"身居仕路梦家山，一日君恩放我还。\n从此便为终老计，祇愁造物靳清閒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43411,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和远老四首 其一","author":"吴芾","text":"事好休时便好休，不应人尽觅封侯。\n归来已快平生志，况有高人来聚头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43412,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和远老韵二首 其二","author":"吴芾","text":"欲访天台帛道猷，梦魂先到石桥头。\n个中直待桃花放，始得从师烂漫游。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43413,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和远老韵二首 其一","author":"吴芾","text":"平生痼疾在烟霞，到处林泉是我家。\n若也远公容入社，直须酤酒不须茶。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43414,"sha256":"1841